# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Growise Media Website — Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values.
# NEVER commit a .env file containing real secrets.
#
# ⚠️  SECURITY MODEL:
#   - VITE_* variables are bundled into the frontend (visible to the browser)
#   - All other variables must ONLY be set as Supabase Secrets (server-side)
#   - Meta API credentials MUST NEVER be set as VITE_* variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Frontend: Supabase (safe to expose — anon key only) ─────────────────────
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-supabase-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SERVER-SIDE ONLY — Supabase Secrets (set via Supabase Dashboard or CLI)
# Run: supabase secrets set <KEY>=<VALUE>
# These are NEVER set in .env or exposed to the browser.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Meta / Instagram Business Discovery API
# See: https://developers.facebook.com/docs/instagram-api/business-discovery-api
#
# META_ACCESS_TOKEN        — Long-lived Page or System User access token
# META_BUSINESS_ACCOUNT_ID — The Instagram Business Account ID used for lookups
# META_GRAPH_VERSION       — API version (default: v26.0)
#
# To set in Supabase:
#   supabase secrets set META_ACCESS_TOKEN=<your-long-lived-token>
#   supabase secrets set META_BUSINESS_ACCOUNT_ID=<your-business-id>
#   supabase secrets set META_GRAPH_VERSION=v26.0

# (DO NOT add META_ACCESS_TOKEN here — set it as a Supabase Secret instead)
